msgid "Inspect and edit a source file"
msgstr "检查与编辑源文件"

msgid "Single-trial GRB localization"
msgstr "单 trial GRB 定位"

msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "教程"

msgid ""
"Read a Cosima source file, inspect the run and source parameters, and save an updated copy. The "
"example uses a GRB template included with the package."
msgstr "读取 Cosima 源文件、检查 run 与 source 参数，并保存修改后的副本。示例使用本包附带的 GRB 模板。"

msgid ""
"To simulate the saved configuration, use a separate MEGAlib installation and point the geometry "
"and orientation entries to files on your system."
msgstr "模拟保存后的配置需要独立安装 MEGAlib，并将 geometry 和 orientation 指向自己系统上的文件。"

msgid ""
"The notebook below shows how to inspect the individual parameter tables. To run it locally, "
":download:`download the notebook <Source_file_interpretion.ipynb>` and open it in JupyterLab from"
" the ``megalibpy`` environment."
msgstr ""
"下面的 notebook 展示各参数表的检查方式。如需本地运行，请 :download:`下载 notebook <Source_file_interpretion.ipynb>`，在 "
"``megalibpy`` 环境下使用 JupyterLab 打开。Notebook 内容保留英文。"

msgid ""
"The localization notebook demonstrates one simulation and reconstruction, random one-second "
"background extraction using a standalone runtime command, component-aware event selection, "
"spectrum/image generation, Galactic peak coordinates and angular separation, and a one-row CSV "
"summary. Update its external paths, scientific configurations and background time bounds before "
"running. Each new simulation requires a fresh workspace. Native execution is not performed during"
" the documentation build."
msgstr ""
"定位 notebook 展示一次模拟与重建、通过独立 runtime 命令随机抽取一秒背景、包含外部成分的事件筛选、谱与图像生成、银河峰位置与角距，以及单行 CSV "
"summary。运行前需修改外部路径、科学配置和背景时间范围。每次新模拟需要新 workspace。文档构建不会执行原生命令；notebook 保持英文。"

msgid ":download:`Download the localization notebook <Localization_workflow.ipynb>`."
msgstr ":download:`下载定位 notebook <Localization_workflow.ipynb>`。"
